    "notes": "Multiplexed magnetic force spectroscopy (Depixus prototype) on hundreds of B. subtilis yitJ SAM-I riboswitch RNAs (native and stabilised versions) hybridised via DNA splint handles between a surface oligo and MyOne T1 beads; force ramps (~1-32 pN), stepped-force and long constant-force experiments yield ligand-dependent unfolding forces, equilibrium forces and state lifetimes for SAM, SAH and Ribocil-C at 1 and 10 mM Mg2+. Kd values are compared with SPR and ITC (non-SMFS)."
